AstroPaper is a minimal blog theme designed around accessibility, useful SEO
metadata, readable typography, and a layout that works across screen sizes.
It is intended as a practical starting point for a personal blog or portfolio.

= Features

- Light and dark color schemes.
- Organized posts, tags, pagination, and archives.
- Responsive and keyboard-accessible navigation.
- RSS, sitemap, canonical URLs, and article metadata.
- Configurable site details and social links.

= Show your support

If the theme is useful to you, visit the
#link("https://github.com/satnaing/astro-paper")[AstroPaper repository], report
issues, or contribute improvements. Search and generated social images are
intentionally outside this example's scope.
